DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The iippss driver provides support for IBM ServeRAID controllers, including:

           ••       ServeRAID 3H/3HB/3L
           ••       ServeRAID 4H/4L/4Lx/4M/4Mx
           ••       ServeRAID 5i/5i II
           ••       ServeRAID 6i/6M
           ••       ServeRAID 7k/7M/7t

     Although the controllers are actual RAID controllers, the driver makes
     them look just like SCSI controllers.  All RAID configuration is done
     through the bootable IBM ServeRAID Support CD; a CD image is freely
     available at the IBM website.

     RAID management is done through the bio(4) device with the bioctl(8) com‐
     mand.  Logical disk status is exposed under the _h_w_._s_e_n_s_o_r_s sysctl(8) and
     can be monitored using sensorsd(8).

